The primary point is that it takes too many turns to engrave with
weapons; 1 turn for _each_ character, 8 turns for the E-word.

One don't want to use his main weapon for that (as you also implied
in your posting), since it dulls.

A maybe minor point is that (even that I'm known to carry quite
everything with me) I don't want to carry any superfluous weight
with me[*]. Daggers weigh 10 units (that's two scrolls or three
rings plus a gem weight equivalent), and if you are close to
burdened (stressed in my case) it might be a factor. A hard gem
(maybe a bit rarer than daggers), OTOH, weighs only 1 unit.

So if you carry additional weapons with you solely for engraving
purposes nothing is wrong with that despite the amount of time you
need which makes it unfeasible to use in emergency situations.

Janis

[*] Yes, cdi, I know it sounds funny in your ears as you know my
